00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:40.160
Just let that run right down the hill.

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:43.710
Always follow the lay of the land when you're doing these.

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:45.270
You don't wanna have the land running this way

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:48.300
